<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Samsung takeover of AST.</title>
<headline>EU clears Samsung takeover of AST.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday that it had approved an offer by Samsung Electronics of South Korea to buy all the shares in California-based U.S. computer maker AST that it does not already own.</p>
<p>The Commission said in a statement that the business being acquired included the manufacture and sale of personal computers.</p>
<p>In this market, AST and Samsung's sales in the European Union were small -- below 5.0 percent -- and virtually no overlap would result from the operation, it added. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
